# Struck steps: a cell the playhead reaches hops up into the gap above it and rings back to rest, once; a cell that
# does not sound does not hop; under MOTION still no cell moves. tests/hop_check.py reads the frames this writes.
wait 300
expect still 0
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
step 2 1 9 48 100
step 2 1 10 48 100
step 2 1 11 48 100
step 2 1 13 48 100
step 2 1 14 48 100
step 2 1 15 48 100
step 2 1 16 48 100
bpm 120
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
